'Even' is strongest, 'odd' and translations of 'even' follow. Focus words
and recognizable pieces of the same word families get weaker responses.
Asynchronous-code markers also get a small response.
Negation, uncertainty, or an alternative just before ' even' damp its value.
All unrecognized tokens get zero. State is only the last 32 characters of
this document, to recognize preceding words and split contractions.
"""
import re

READS = ()

