"""Layer-0 MLP feature that reads the prepositions "for" and "with".

The unit responds to the English word "for" (activation about 0.8) and "with"
(about 1.1) whatever their case or spacing: " for", "For", "_for", "with", " WITH".
Their foreign-language equivalents ("für", "mit", "avec", "для", "con", ...) give
a weaker response of about 0.45. Every other token gives 0.
"""

READS = ()

LEVEL = {"for": 0.8, "with": 1.1}
TRANSLATIONS = {"für", "mit", "avec", "voor", "för", "для", "con", "com"}


